{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>ולא יבואו.</b> The Kohathites shall not enter the Tent of Meeting to see, as it were, the swallowing of the sacred. The meaning: when its structure is dismantled, the curtain of the partition is removed and the ark is exposed. Some say כבלע is like ככסות, and the meaning: when they cover the ark to carry it. This is a meaning close to the first. Now there are two warnings: that they not touch the sacred objects, but shall carry them only by the poles, and that they not look upon the sacred."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:19.338363399Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}